她的头确实挺怪的。

789
00:33:44.180 --> 00:33:48.100
And then Michael says we should sell her an elevator pass.
然后迈克尔说我们应该卖给她一张电梯通行证。

790
00:33:48.360 --> 00:33:51.100
And Dwight's like, but our elevator doesn't require.
结果德怀特说，可是我们的电梯不需要……

791
00:33:51.100 --> 00:33:53.100
Ah, hazing.
啊，恶作剧整人。

792
00:33:54.300 --> 00:33:54.860
Hazing.
整蛊新人。

793
00:33:55.420 --> 00:33:58.920
This is going to kick off a whole storyline for Dwight.
这拉开了德怀特整条故事线的序幕。

794
00:33:59.100 --> 00:34:02.580
Dwight is going to really lean into this idea of hazing Holly.
德怀特接下来要全力投入到整蛊霍莉这个想法中去了。

795
00:34:02.840 --> 00:34:03.160
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

796
00:34:03.440 --> 00:34:04.620
Dwight's on a mission now.
德怀特现在斗志昂扬。

797
00:34:04.760 --> 00:34:07.040
You know, he loves having a call to action.
你知道的，他最喜欢有明确的目标去执行了。

798
00:34:07.560 --> 00:34:11.880
Meanwhile, Phyllis is trying to find an anti-gravity machine.
与此同时，菲利斯正试图找一台反重力机器。

799
00:34:12.100 --> 00:34:16.360
So far, she's only found someone who can connect her to antidepressants.
到目前为止，她只找到了一个能帮她买到抗抑郁药的人。

800
00:34:17.020 --> 00:34:20.640
I am telling you, I have a catch at 7 minutes, 39 seconds.
我跟你说，我在7分39秒处发现了一个槽点。

801
00:34:20.860 --> 00:34:25.100
Phyllis is about to break when the lady on the phone says antidepressants.
菲莉丝快要崩溃了，这时电话那头的女士说出了“抗抑郁药”。

802
00:34:25.220 --> 00:34:26.880
You can see her starting to laugh.
你能看到她开始笑出声来。

803
00:34:27.120 --> 00:34:34.280
We had a fan question about this, Angela, from Haley S, Corinne T, Rose P, and Joe S.
安吉拉，我们收到了关于这一段的粉丝提问，来自海莉·S、科琳·T、罗斯·P和乔·S。

804
00:34:34.500 --> 00:34:39.040
They said, who is she talking to on the phone?
他们问，她在跟电话里的谁说话？

805
00:34:39.300 --> 00:34:42.760
Because many of them think it sounds like Amy Ryan.
因为他们很多人觉得听起来像埃米·瑞安。

806
00:34:42.760 --> 00:34:46.980
They were like, did Amy Ryan fill in as the woman on the phone?
他们在想，是不是埃米·瑞安客串了电话里的那个女人？

807
00:34:47.360 --> 00:34:48.860
No, she did not.
不，并不是。

808
00:34:49.040 --> 00:34:51.000
I asked Kentopedia about this.
我向肯托百科求证过这件事。

809
00:34:51.200 --> 00:34:55.620
He said that we auditioned seven women to do this voiceover.
他说我们当时试镜了七位女性来录这段画外音。

810
00:34:55.800 --> 00:34:59.300
He's pretty sure that we went with actress Molly Hagan.
他很确定我们最终选用了演员莫莉·哈根。

811
00:34:59.520 --> 00:35:02.380
I could not find this part credited anywhere online.
我在网上任何地方都找不到这个角色的演职员表。

812
00:35:02.420 --> 00:35:06.820
But I will tell you, if you saw Molly Hagan, you would recognize her.
但我可以告诉你，如果你看到莫莉·哈根，你一定能认出她。

813
00:35:06.980 --> 00:35:09.220
She's this brilliant, comedic actress.
她是一位才华横溢的喜剧演员。

814
00:35:09.440 --> 00:35:12.240
I'd also like to point out, she's been on Monk.
我还想指出的是，她演过《神探阿蒙》。

815
00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:13.520
Oh, no way.
哦，不会吧。

816
00:35:13.880 --> 00:35:14.320
Yeah.
对啊。

817
00:35:14.620 --> 00:35:18.920
I mean, Molly Hagan is like such a fantastic character actress.
我的意思是，莫莉·哈根绝对是一位超级出色的性格演员。

818
00:35:19.220 --> 00:35:20.980
Like, if we got her, we were so lucky.
所以，如果我们能请到她，真的是太幸运了。

819
00:35:21.220 --> 00:35:21.900
I know.
我也这么觉得。

820
00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:27.200
Folks out there listening, I want you to know there are many, many more delicious
听节目的各位，我想让你们知道，还有许许多多精彩的

821
00:35:27.980 --> 00:35:30.960
deleted Phyllis scenes as she tries to plan this party.
菲莉丝试图筹办这场派对的被删减片段。

822
00:35:31.200 --> 00:35:31.920
So many.
非常多。

823
00:35:32.120 --> 00:35:34.920
But I would like to play one of my favorites for you now.
但我现在想放其中我最喜欢的一段给你们听。

824
00:35:35.120 --> 00:35:36.260
It's from the DVD.
它在DVD里。

825
00:35:36.660 --> 00:35:38.400
It's a scene between Kevin and Phyllis.
这是凯文和菲莉丝之间的一场戏。

826
00:35:38.540 --> 00:35:41.880
And then, of course, a little bit of Angela's ass at the end.
当然，最后还有安吉拉的一点屁股镜头。

827
00:35:43.740 --> 00:35:44.220
Yes?
什么？

828
00:35:44.740 --> 00:35:45.720
Good news, Phil.
好消息，菲尔。

829
00:35:46.200 --> 00:35:48.460
The band just had a last-minute cancellation.
乐队刚才有个演出临时取消了。

830
00:35:49.080 --> 00:35:52.520
So we are available to play at the going-away party tonight.
所以我们今晚有空去欢送派对上演出。

831
00:35:53.200 --> 00:35:53.900
No way.
少来这套。

832
00:35:54.140 --> 00:35:55.800
After what you guys did at my wedding?
忘了你们在我婚礼上干的好事吗？

833
00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:57.080
That wasn't me, Phyllis.
那不是我，菲莉丝。

834
00:35:57.180 --> 00:35:58.860
That was Chester on bass.
那是弹贝斯的切斯特。

835
00:35:58.860 --> 00:36:04.700
I'm talking about 30 police songs in a row, all off-key, off-temple, and you forgot at
我说的是连续三十首警察乐队的歌，全都跑调、不在拍子上，而且你们至少忘了一

836
00:36:04.700 --> 00:36:06.540
least half the lyrics.
半的歌词。

837
00:36:06.860 --> 00:36:09.300
But, Phyllis, that was Scrantonicity.
但是，菲莉丝，那是“斯克兰托尼城乐队”。

838
00:36:09.920 --> 00:36:10.440
Day work.
日常工作。

839
00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:14.640
Now, I am with Scrantonicity, too.
现在，我也是“斯克兰托尼城乐队”的成员了。

840
00:36:14.640 --> 00:36:16.920
Give me a break.
饶了我吧。

841
00:36:17.540 --> 00:36:18.780
Fine, Phyllis.
好吧，菲莉丝。

842
00:36:19.260 --> 00:36:21.620
I'm sorry that I ruined your wedding.
很抱歉我搞砸了你的婚礼。

843
00:36:22.220 --> 00:36:24.780
I didn't mean Kev.
我不是指这个，凯夫。

844
00:36:25.120 --> 00:36:25.840
Kevin.
凯文。

845
00:36:26.800 --> 00:36:28.080
Nice job.
干得漂亮。

846
00:36:28.520 --> 00:36:29.220
Real nice.
真是太棒了。

847
00:36:30.520 --> 00:36:31.380
Thank you.
谢谢你。

848
00:36:31.960 --> 00:36:33.380
I didn't mean it.
我不是故意的。

849
00:36:33.640 --> 00:36:34.120
Really?
真的吗？

850
00:36:34.320 --> 00:36:35.320
You didn't mean it?
你不是故意的？

851
00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:37.160
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

852
00:36:37.420 --> 00:36:39.600
So many great details about Phyllis' wedding.
关于菲莉丝的婚礼，有太多精彩的细节了。

853
00:36:40.680 --> 00:36:42.940
30 police songs in a row.
连续三十首警匪片歌曲。

854
00:36:43.440 --> 00:36:45.460
Off-key, off-tempo.
走调，拍子全乱。

855
00:36:45.580 --> 00:36:46.940
They didn't know all the words.
他们连歌词都没记全。

856
00:36:47.080 --> 00:36:47.960
That would be horrible.
那一定太糟糕了。

857
00:36:48.380 --> 00:36:49.520
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

858
00:36:49.520 --> 00:36:54.460
And then I pop in at the end, and Jenna, for this scene, I remember filming it, because
然后我在最后现身，珍娜，这场戏我还记得拍摄时的情形，因为

859
00:36:54.460 --> 00:36:58.620
I'm supposed to walk into the conference room like I overheard, like way to go, but
我本该像是不小心听到一样走进会议室，就好像干得漂亮，但是

860
00:36:58.620 --> 00:36:59.540
they couldn't hide my belly.
他们遮不住我的肚子。

861
00:36:59.680 --> 00:37:05.760
So they had me snuggle up to the wall and then lean, like lean my head around the corner.
所以他们让我紧靠着墙，然后倾身，像是把头探过墙角那样。

862
00:37:05.920 --> 00:37:06.940
It was so awkward.
太尴尬了。

863
00:37:07.120 --> 00:37:12.480
And on set that day was an NBC photographer, and he was in the conference room, and he took
那天片场有个NBC的摄影师，他当时在会议室里，然后他拍下了

864
00:37:12.480 --> 00:37:15.420
this picture of me leaning around the corner.
我探着头靠在墙角这张照片。

865
00:37:15.660 --> 00:37:18.820
And, lady, it's the photo they used on so many things.
天哪，这就是他们在很多地方都用过的那张照片。

866
00:37:18.820 --> 00:37:20.380
And I'm so clearly pregnant.
而且我孕相那么明显。

867
00:37:20.620 --> 00:37:21.600
I'm like, this photo?
我都想说，就这张照片？

868
00:37:21.840 --> 00:37:24.320
This is the day you're going to take my picture?
这就是你们要拍我的照片的日子？

869
00:37:25.560 --> 00:37:26.820
I'm going to put it in stories.
我要把它发到动态里。

870
00:37:26.820 --> 00:37:27.740
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

871
00:37:27.820 --> 00:37:29.140
Whenever I see it, I'm like, really?
每当我看到它，我都会想，真的吗？

872
00:37:29.580 --> 00:37:30.820
There's no other photo?
就没有别的照片了吗？

873
00:37:30.980 --> 00:37:31.740
This was the photo.
偏偏就是这张照片。

874
00:37:31.920 --> 00:37:33.020
This will live forever.
这张照片会永远流传下去。

875
00:37:33.720 --> 00:37:34.160
Great.
太棒了。

876
00:37:34.560 --> 00:37:34.780
Fantastic.
好极了。

877
00:37:35.420 --> 00:37:35.470
Congratulations.
恭喜啊。

878
00:37:36.220 --> 00:37:36.840
Thank you.
谢谢。

879
00:37:36.900 --> 00:37:40.520
Well, now Toby is going to bring Holly to meet Michael.
好了，现在托比要带霍莉去见迈克尔了。

880
00:37:41.160 --> 00:37:43.620
Michael is so annoyed.
迈克尔烦透了。

881
00:37:44.780 --> 00:37:45.220
Yeah.
是啊。

882
00:37:45.560 --> 00:37:47.660
Now he's got to deal with female Toby.
现在他得应付女版托比了。

883
00:37:47.660 --> 00:37:51.480
He says, listen, my job is to make the office fun.
他说，听着，我的工作是让办公室充满乐趣。

884
00:37:51.640 --> 00:37:53.640
Your job is to make the office lame.
你的工作是让办公室无趣透顶。

885
00:37:53.920 --> 00:37:55.320
Only one of us can win.
我们俩只有一个人能赢。

886
00:37:55.620 --> 00:37:58.380
He's basically like, newsflash, it's going to be me.
他基本上就是这意思，快醒醒吧，赢的人肯定是我。

887
00:37:59.080 --> 00:38:03.060
And then Holly throws him a total curveball.
然后霍莉抛出了一个完全让人意想不到的怪球。

888
00:38:03.400 --> 00:38:06.020
She turns to Toby and is like, what did you do to him?
她转向托比问，你对他做什么了？

889
00:38:06.180 --> 00:38:07.120
And Toby's like, nothing.
托比说，什么都没做。

890
00:38:07.380 --> 00:38:09.980
And Michael's like, no, he tortured me with his awfulness.
迈克尔则说，不，他用他那令人讨厌的劲头折磨我。

891
00:38:10.120 --> 00:38:12.540
And then Holly's like, yeah, I know what you mean.
接着霍莉说，对，我懂你的意思。

892
00:38:12.700 --> 00:38:15.500
I nearly fell asleep when he gave me a tour of the files.
他带我参观档案室时我差点睡着。

893
00:38:15.500 --> 00:38:16.880
Michael is thrown.
迈克尔被整懵了。

894
00:38:17.100 --> 00:38:18.420
He has met his person.
他遇到克星了。

895
00:38:18.580 --> 00:38:19.060
I know.
我知道。

896
00:38:19.180 --> 00:38:19.940
And it's crazy.
而且太疯狂了。

897
00:38:20.240 --> 00:38:21.160
It's two sentences.
就两句话。

898
00:38:21.460 --> 00:38:22.540
And he's in love.
他就坠入爱河了。

899
00:38:23.200 --> 00:38:23.640
Yeah.
是啊。

900
00:38:23.720 --> 00:38:26.640
All of a sudden, she is the most attractive, wonderful woman he's ever met.
突然之间，她成了他见过的最有吸引力、最完美的女人。

901
00:38:26.900 --> 00:38:30.360
He has this great talking head where he says, you know what?
他有一段精彩的访谈镜头，在里面他说，你知道吗？

902
00:38:30.600 --> 00:38:35.500
Thanks to Toby, he believed that the HR department was a breeding ground for monsters.
托比让他坚信，人事部门简直是怪物的温床。

903
00:38:35.500 --> 00:38:39.900
But what he failed to realize was that not all monsters are bad.
但他没有意识到的是，并不是所有的怪物都是坏的。

904
00:38:40.080 --> 00:38:44.140
Like E.T., is Holly their E.T.?
就像E.T.一样，霍莉是他们的E.T.吗？

905
00:38:44.140 --> 00:38:44.900
Yeah.
没错。

906
00:38:45.160 --> 00:38:46.560
Is Holly our extraterrestrial?
霍莉是我们的外星人吗？

907
00:38:46.820 --> 00:38:46.980
Yeah.
没错。

908
00:38:47.640 --> 00:38:50.540
She's just an awesome woman from this planet.
她只是这个星球上一个超棒的女人。

909
00:38:55.320 --> 00:38:55.840
Gosh.
天哪。

910
00:38:56.100 --> 00:38:58.160
Well, Holly is going to keep making the rounds.
好吧，霍莉接下来还要四处转转。

911
00:38:58.160 --> 00:39:00.100
She's going to keep meeting people in the office.
她会接着和办公室里的大家见面。

912
00:39:00.280 --> 00:39:02.480
But before we do that, should we take a quick break?
但在我们继续之前，要不要休息一会儿？

913
00:39:03.360 --> 00:39:07.660
Yes, because I texted Creed about the moment that Creed meets Holly.
好啊，因为我给克里德发了短信，聊了聊克里德与霍莉见面的那个瞬间。

914
00:39:07.860 --> 00:39:09.320
And I'll share that when we come back.
等我们回来后我会分享那个。

915
00:39:09.560 --> 00:39:09.610
Yay!
太棒了！

916
00:39:09.740 --> 00:39:10.280
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

917
00:39:20.960 --> 00:39:21.360
All right.
好的。

918
00:39:21.420 --> 00:39:22.000
We are back.
我们回来了。

919
00:39:22.180 --> 00:39:27.380
There is a fantastic scene between Creed and Holly where Holly's like, hey, I look forward
克里德和霍莉之间有一场绝妙的戏，霍莉说，嘿，我很期待

920
00:39:27.380 --> 00:39:30.480
to, you know, spending time with you and finding out what it is you do here.
你知道的，和你相处，并了解你在这里到底是做什么的。

921
00:39:30.600 --> 00:39:31.680
What do you do here?
你在这里是做什么的？

922
00:39:32.960 --> 00:39:35.520
And Creed's little computer shuts down.
然后克里德的小脑瓜瞬间宕机了。

923
00:39:35.700 --> 00:39:36.760
His brain is like, oh, God.
他的大脑在想，噢，天哪。

924
00:39:36.920 --> 00:39:37.320
Oh, God.
噢，天哪。

925
00:39:37.320 --> 00:39:43.160
So I texted with Creed Bratton about this, and he said he was so excited for the scene.
所以我为此给克里德·布拉顿发了短信，他说他特别期待这场戏。

926
00:39:43.380 --> 00:39:46.480
He knew it was definitely in his comedy wheelhouse.
他知道这绝对符合他的喜剧风格。

927
00:39:46.660 --> 00:39:53.440
And he said he purposely took an extra long beat after he shook hands with Holly and then
他说他故意在和霍莉握手之后留出了一段超长的停顿，然后

928
00:39:53.440 --> 00:39:54.160
walked away.
才走开。

929
00:39:54.300 --> 00:39:56.160
He really wanted to drag out that moment.
他是真的很想把那个时刻拉长。

930
00:39:56.360 --> 00:40:00.680
I thought it was so great because then it cuts to him hiding behind the refrigerator in the
我觉得这太棒了，因为镜头随即切到他躲在厨房的

931
00:40:00.680 --> 00:40:00.980
kitchen.
冰箱后面。

932
00:40:01.160 --> 00:40:03.480
And he's like, what is wrong with this woman?
他在想，这个女人到底有什么毛病？

933
00:40:03.680 --> 00:40:06.100
She's asking about stuff that's nobody's business.
她问的事根本不管别人的事。

934
00:40:06.360 --> 00:40:07.240
What do I do?
我到底是做什么的？

935
00:40:07.320 --> 00:40:11.340
You're a choir, choir, choir, choir, quibbity, choir, quibbity, choir assurance.
你是品、品、品、品、品质……品质保证。

936
00:40:11.840 --> 00:40:12.320
Yes.
没错。

937
00:40:12.560 --> 00:40:14.540
His job is quality assurance.
他的工作是品质保证。

938
00:40:15.180 --> 00:40:15.660
Yeah.
对。

939
00:40:15.960 --> 00:40:18.480
And he's like, no, no, no, no, no, but I'm getting close.
然后他在想，不，不，不，不，不，但我快想出来了。

940
00:40:18.780 --> 00:40:21.300
But I just thought Creed was so great in it.
但我只是觉得克里德在里面的表现太棒了。

941
00:40:21.420 --> 00:40:21.900
So good.
太棒了。

942
00:40:22.260 --> 00:40:26.820
Well, Dwight is going to ask Holly if she has met Kevin yet.
接下来德怀特要问霍莉她有没有见过凯文。

943
00:40:27.160 --> 00:40:33.620
And as part of his hazing, he is going to tell her that Kevin is here as part of a special
作为捉弄新人的一部分，他打算告诉霍莉，凯文是因为智力低下

